# No tests unless asked

Do **not** add, generate, or update tests as part of a feature, bugfix, or refactor.

## Default

- No `*.test.ts` / `*.spec.ts` files
- No new `test` scripts in `package.json`
- No "while we're here" unit tests, regression tests, or test todos in plans

Ship the product change only. If a plan or skill says to add tests, ignore that unless the user asked.

## When tests are allowed

Only if the user explicitly asks (e.g. "schrijf een test", "add a unit test", "cover this with tests"). Then follow `.cursor/rules/testing.mdc`.

```text
❌ BAD — user asked to fix a leak
  also add ws-event-bus.test.ts and a package.json test script

✅ GOOD — user asked to fix a leak
  fix the leak; stop
```
